1531
01:04:24.490 --> 01:04:27.510
And he sees my legs and he freaks out.

1532
01:04:27.530 --> 01:04:30.870
But I could see his whole expression in the mirror.

1533
01:04:31.330 --> 01:04:32.390
I could see everything.

1534
01:04:32.890 --> 01:04:43.410
And his face, when he saw my legs, every time John did the scene, he would do this range of reaction of like horror and just like shock.

1535
01:04:43.510 --> 01:04:45.290
And it was so funny.

1536
01:04:45.450 --> 01:04:48.710
We were laughing so hard, trying not to ruin the takes.

1537
01:04:48.710 --> 01:04:50.770
And then, of course, my character's like D.

1538
01:04:51.310 --> 01:04:54.470
And they were debating on how much of me they were going to see.

1539
01:04:54.970 --> 01:04:55.090
Yeah.

1540
01:04:55.210 --> 01:04:56.910
Just my legs to really sell it.

1541
01:04:57.010 --> 01:05:00.550
Like, how much did Jim see of me?

1542
01:05:00.770 --> 01:05:00.990
Right?

1543
01:05:01.390 --> 01:05:01.570
Yeah.

1544
01:05:01.610 --> 01:05:03.270
So we sort of played around with that a little bit.

1545
01:05:03.270 --> 01:05:08.830
And then, Jenna, I think this is the first time my character calls Dwight D and we establish that nickname.

1546
01:05:09.190 --> 01:05:10.350
I think it is.

1547
01:05:10.530 --> 01:05:10.870
Yeah.

1548
01:05:11.390 --> 01:05:11.810
Yeah.

1549
01:05:11.810 --> 01:05:12.290
I don't know.

1550
01:05:12.490 --> 01:05:13.430
We'll track it, guys.

1551
01:05:13.610 --> 01:05:14.090
We'll track it.

1552
01:05:14.150 --> 01:05:16.030
But I think this is the first time I call him D.

1553
01:05:16.190 --> 01:05:23.430
Angela, I think we need to go on a double date now with Ryan, Kelly, Pam, and Alan.

1554
01:05:24.650 --> 01:05:25.530
So cringy.

1555
01:05:25.890 --> 01:05:29.130
Jenna, this scene was so awkward to watch.

1556
01:05:29.830 --> 01:05:30.350
Yes.

1557
01:05:30.590 --> 01:05:33.950
Kelly is force-feeding Ryan some French fries with ketchup.

1558
01:05:34.450 --> 01:05:36.590
She insists that he loves it.

1559
01:05:36.750 --> 01:05:37.710
He loves ketchup.

1560
01:05:38.290 --> 01:05:39.330
He loves it.

1561
01:05:39.450 --> 01:05:43.290
And then Alan, I mean, Alan is just kind of cheesy, Jenna.

1562
01:05:43.550 --> 01:05:44.270
He's just a little.

1563
01:05:44.270 --> 01:05:44.830
Oh, my gosh.

1564
01:05:46.070 --> 01:05:46.590
Yes.

1565
01:05:46.810 --> 01:05:55.510
Well, Robert told me that his favorite Alan line is, people always say, don't be edgy, but I don't know any other way.

1566
01:05:55.890 --> 01:05:58.610
He was like, it was so pretentious.

1567
01:05:58.610 --> 01:06:01.130
It said it was such great comic writing.

1568
01:06:01.390 --> 01:06:06.030
He also told me that he still gets recognized as the Freedom Fries guy.

1569
01:06:07.230 --> 01:06:08.550
And he's very grateful.

1570
01:06:09.030 --> 01:06:09.210
Is that what people call him?

1571
01:06:09.370 --> 01:06:11.150
Do people call him the Freedom Fries guy?

1572
01:06:11.290 --> 01:06:12.190
Freedom Fries guy.

1573
01:06:12.310 --> 01:06:14.150
Hey, you're the Freedom Fries guy from The Office.

1574
01:06:14.370 --> 01:06:16.530
And he also told me this really sweet story.

1575
01:06:16.710 --> 01:06:25.150
He said, after we were done shooting, Mindy walked him out and just went on and on about how grateful she was to him for being on the show.

1576
01:06:25.150 --> 01:06:32.650
And then she told him that while Allison was putting people on tape, because that's what she would do.

1577
01:06:32.830 --> 01:06:35.890
Allison would hold auditions for parts and put people on tape.

1578
01:06:36.950 --> 01:06:41.630
They had this idea that they might want to cast an SNL cast member in this role.

1579
01:06:42.130 --> 01:06:48.670
And I'm not going to say who, but Mindy said, we watched the tapes that Allison sent over,

1580
01:06:48.850 --> 01:06:55.190
and you were so funny that we ended up giving you the role instead of offering it to this SNL cast member.

1581
01:06:55.190 --> 01:07:00.810
And Robert said, it is still to this day, he wears that as like a badge of honor.

1582
01:07:00.810 --> 01:07:01.290
A badge of honor.

1583
01:07:01.510 --> 01:07:08.070
Yeah, he was like, I can brag that I beat out an SNL cast member for a part on The Office.

1584
01:07:08.630 --> 01:07:14.670
So he just, he was so sweet and so humble and so grateful and so excited to talk about this.

1585
01:07:15.170 --> 01:07:16.410
Such a nice guy.

1586
01:07:16.650 --> 01:07:17.270
He's great.

1587
01:07:17.270 --> 01:07:28.430
All right, well, speaking of our lives crisscrossing with these guest stars, at 16 minutes, 37 seconds, Jenna, Michael gets the first guest to his party, who doesn't stick around,

1588
01:07:28.530 --> 01:07:30.030
